-- Stat weights per class and role, as data. Source: GearQuest Forever (Henrik8210), as published in
-- Pawn Forever (turlockmike, MIT). These are community estimates, not measured from the game, so
-- Gear Advisor labels every score built from them as an estimate. Pawn counts crit, hit, haste, dodge,
-- parry and block per 1%; they are divided by the rating per 1% Pawn Forever measured on Forever
-- tooltips (crit 14, hit 10, dodge 12, parry 15; haste 10 and block 5 are its estimates) to give a
-- weight per rating point. Stat names are the game's ITEM_MOD_* keys; the ones not yet seen on a Forever
-- item (spell power, ranged attack power, block, parry) are assumed until /tempus gearstats confirms them.
-- DPS_RANGED is the weight for a ranged weapon's DPS. Expertise, defense, health, mana and resistances
-- are left out: no verified conversion yet.
